From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 07 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: drm/xe: Add BPM_MMU_INTERVAL_NOTIFIER_TWOPASS_NOT_PRESENT guards for single-pass compat

Guard two-pass MMU interval notifier code with BPM_MMU_INTERVAL_NOTIFIER_TWOPASS_NOT_PRESENT
in xe_tlb_inval, xe_vm_types, xe_vm, and xe_vm_madvise so that older kernels
without the two-pass interface can still compile.  Add xe_vm_range_tilemask_tlb_inval()
as the single-pass fallback.

Signed-off-by: Pravalika Gurram <pravalika.gurram@intel.com>
